# Security Identity Infrastructure Rules

- Keep ASP.NET Core Identity in Infrastructure only.
- `ApplicationUser : IdentityUser<Guid>` must not contain domain business fields.
- Persist and read permission claims using canonical claim type constants.
- Never log secrets, tokens, or PII in security flows.
- Do not merge Identity entities with Domain entities.
